  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: sorrawit-dev-helper (npm)",
  "details": "The package ships no code; its postinstall hook runs a node one-liner that reads /tmp/flag.txt and exfiltrates the file contents to the remote endpoint hxxps://ca37-49-237-83-218[.]ngrok-free[.]app/?flag=[.][.]. via an HTTP GET. Installing the package triggers the file read and the outbound exfiltration to the ngrok tunnel host.",
